* text=auto

# Phase 11.3: byte-exact golden fixtures must survive git checkout unchanged on
# every OS. `text=auto` would otherwise risk CRLF/EOL mangling of binary parity
# files on Windows<->Linux CI checkouts, silently breaking byte-compare tests.
*.safetensors binary
*.gguf binary
*.bin binary
*.f32 binary
*.pt binary
*.npz binary

# The app icon is embedded into the exe by crates/quant-cli/build.rs, so its
# bytes are load-bearing on every platform: EOL mangling here would produce an
# rc.exe that embeds a different (or corrupt) icon. Same reasoning as the
# parity goldens above.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
